  "description": "In the chaotic martial arts world, powerful relics known as \"Artifacts\" contain the immense powers of ancient heroes, granting their wielders the ability to use these powers freely. To prevent disorder and maintain peace, the Martial Alliance establishes an organization called the \"Crown\" to retrieve these artifacts. However, the Crown's leader secretly seeks to use the artifacts' power to dominate the martial arts world. The protagonist, Gongson Rang, rises to stop the Crown's leader and strives to bring true peace to the martial arts community.    \n\n*\"Those who hold the Artifact shall hold the martial arts world.\"*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Mootoon](https://www.mootoon.co.kr/comic/moo_list.mg?tcode=quwo), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9266938), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/59655708)",
